('AI Image Generation & Editing: The Complete Guide for Content Creators in 2026',
 'ai-image-generation-guide',
 'Learn how to create stunning visuals with AI image generation. From social media graphics to product mockups, discover how PeakDraft''s 2-step pipeline and natural language editing revolutionize visual content creation.',
 E'## How PeakDraft''s 2-Step AI Pipeline Works\n\nUnlike basic image generators, PeakDraft uses a sophisticated 2-step process:\n\n### Step 1: Expert Prompt Engineering\nYour description is first processed by an advanced text AI that acts as a professional creative director.\n\n### Step 2: Image Generation\nThe refined prompt is fed to a state-of-the-art image generation model.\n\n## 8 Template Types\n\n- **Social Media Posts** - Square images for Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn\n- **YouTube Thumbnails** - Wide images for maximum CTR\n- **Posters** - Portrait images with cinematic composition\n- **Advertisements** - Conversion-focused layouts\n- **Logos** - Clean, memorable, scalable designs\n- **Banners** - Ultra-wide images for website heroes\n- **Product Mockups** - Photorealistic presentations\n- **Infographics** - Structured visual layouts\n\n## 6 Style Presets\n\n- **Minimal**: Swiss/Scandinavian design\n- **Vibrant**: Electric colors with gradient meshes\n- **Professional**: Fortune 500 quality\n- **Artistic**: Painterly textures\n- **Dark & Moody**: Deep blacks, neon accents\n- **Retro**: Nostalgic color grading\n\n## Natural Language Editing\n\nDescribe changes in plain English to refine your images.',
 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122102-3fe601e05bd2?w=1200&h=600&fit=crop',
 'AI Image Generation', ARRAY['AI', 'image generation', 'visual content'], 'PeakDraft Team', 'published', '2026-02-27T00:00:00Z',
 'AI Image Generation Guide 2026', 'Complete guide to AI image generation for content creators.', ARRAY['AI image generation', 'design tool'], 11, true),

