('How to Write SEO-Optimized Blog Posts with AI in 2026',
 'how-to-write-seo-blog-posts',
 'Master SEO content creation using AI tools. Proven strategies for ranking higher on Google.',
 E'## Key SEO Elements\n\n1. **Keyword Research**: Identify targets before writing\n2. **Title Optimization**: Include primary keywords\n3. **Header Structure**: Use H2, H3 with secondary keywords\n4. **Meta Descriptions**: Under 160 characters\n5. **Internal Linking**: Connect related content\n6. **Content Length**: 1,500+ words for comprehensive topics\n\n## Using PeakDraft for SEO\n\nOur Blog Generator incorporates SEO best practices automatically.\n\n## Pro Tips\n- Use Humanize feature for natural AI content\n- Add personal experiences\n- Update content regularly\n- Include images with alt text',
 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1432888498266-38ffec3eaf0a?w=1200&h=600&fit=crop',
 'SEO', ARRAY['SEO', 'blog writing'], 'PeakDraft Team', 'published', '2025-12-28T00:00:00Z',
 'How to Write SEO Blog Posts with AI', 'Learn SEO blog writing strategies.', ARRAY['SEO blog posts'], 7, false),

