 E'## High-Converting Descriptions\n\n1. **Lead with Benefits**\n2. **Use Sensory Language**\n3. **Address Objections**\n4. **Include Social Proof**\n5. **Create Urgency**\n6. **Optimize for SEO**\n\n## Formula\n- Hook → Benefits → Features → Proof → CTA\n\nPeakDraft creates compelling descriptions with persuasive language and SEO keywords.',
